/// Create an empty appendable segment configured with a deferred threshold.
///
/// Points that are assigned an internal ID `>= deferred_internal_id` are stored in deferred
/// (not-yet-indexed) state. Since internal IDs are handed out sequentially starting from `0`, the
/// first `deferred_internal_id` points inserted will be non-deferred, and every subsequently
/// inserted point will be deferred.
